<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Pour toi</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,500&family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,500;1,9..144,500&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500&family=Give+You+Glory&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --plum-deep: #241220;
    --plum: #341c30;
    --rose: #e8b4bc;
    --rose-soft: #f4d9dd;
    --gold: #cda15e;
    --cream: #f7ede6;
    --text-dim: #e3d2da;
    --gossip-bg: #f7f2ea;
    --gossip-ink: #181410;
    --gossip-line: #d8cdb8;
    --gossip-caption: #4a4033;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html,body{height:100%;}
  body{
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% -10%, var(--plum) 0%, var(--plum-deep) 55%, #150b13 100%);
    color: var(--cream);
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    min-height:100vh;
    overflow-x:hidden;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    position:relative;
  }

  .music-player{
    position:fixed;
    bottom: 14px;
    right: 14px;
    width: 260px;
    max-width: calc(100vw - 28px);
    z-index: 50;
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    background: var(--plum-deep);
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1), opacity 0.4s ease;
  }
  .music-player.hidden{
    transform: translateX(calc(100% + 28px));
    opacity:0;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .music-player iframe{
    display:block;
    width:100%;
    height:152px;
    border:none;
  }
  .music-fallback{
    display:block;
    text-align:center;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.5rem 0.7rem;
    font-family:'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size:0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    text-decoration:none;
    opacity:0.8;
  }
  .music-fallback:hover{ opacity:1; text-decoration:underline; }

  .music-arrow{
    position:fixed;
    z-index:51;
    width:34px;
    height:34px;
    border-radius:50%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(232,180,188,0.4);
    background: var(--plum-deep);
    color: var(--cream);
    font-size:1rem;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    cursor:pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, opacity 0.3s ease;
  }
  .music-arrow:hover{ transform: scale(1.08); }
  #music-hide{
    bottom: 14px;
    right: 268px;
  }
  #music-show{
    bottom: 14px;
    right: 14px;
    display:none;
  }
  .petal{
    position:fixed;
    top:-5vh;
    font-size:1.1rem;
    color: var(--rose);
    opacity:0.55;
    pointer-events:none;
    animation: fall linear infinite;
    z-index:0;
  }
  @keyframes fall{
    to{ transform: translateY(110vh) rotate(360deg); opacity:0; }
  }

  .gate{
    z-index:1;
    min-height:100vh;
    width:100%;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    text-align:center;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .gate-question{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-weight:500;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 3.2rem);
    line-height:1.2;
    max-width: 480px;
  }
  .gate-answer{
    margin-top:1.6rem;
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-style:normal;
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 4vw, 1.7rem);
    color: var(--cream);
    text-shadow: 0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    max-width: 440px;
    line-height:1.5;
    min-height:1.5em;
  }
  .gate-buttons{
    margin-top: 2.4rem;
    display:flex;
    gap:1rem;
  }
  .gate-buttons button, #continue-btn{
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid rgba(232,180,188,0.5);
    color: var(--cream);
    padding: 0.85rem 2.2rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-family:'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size:0.95rem;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .gate-buttons button:hover, #continue-btn:hover{
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: var(--gold);
    background: rgba(205,161,94,0.12);
  }
  #yes-btn{
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rose), var(--gold));
    color: var(--plum-deep);
    border:none;
  }
  #continue-btn{
    margin-top: 2rem;
    display:none;
  }
  .gate.hidden{
    display:none;
  }
  #site{
    display:none;
    width:100%;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    opacity:0;
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease;
  }
  #site.visible{
    display:flex;
    opacity:1;
  }

  /* ---- Présentation : déco + enveloppe ---- */
  .deco-icon{
    position:fixed;
    top:-6vh;
    font-size:1.3rem;
    pointer-events:none;
    animation: fall linear infinite;
    z-index:0;
    opacity:0.85;
  }

  #presentation{
    display:none;
    min-height:100vh;
    width:100%;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    text-align:center;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    opacity:0;
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease;
  }
  #presentation.visible{
    display:flex;
    opacity:1;
  }
  .presentation-title{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-weight:500;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5.5vw, 2.6rem);
    z-index:1;
  }
  .presentation-sub{
    margin-top:0.6rem;
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style:italic;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size:1.1rem;
    z-index:1;
  }

  .envelope{
    position:relative;
    width: 230px;
    height: 150px;
    margin: 2.6rem auto 0.4rem;
    cursor:pointer;
    z-index:1;
    perspective: 900px;
  }
  .envelope-body{
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--rose), #cf8f9a);
    border-radius:10px;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    display:flex;
    align-items:flex-end;
    justify-content:center;
    padding-bottom:12px;
    z-index:1;
  }
  .envelope-icon{
    font-size:1.7rem;
  }
  .envelope-flap{
    position:absolute;
    top:0; left:0; width:0; height:0;
    border-left: 115px solid transparent;
    border-right: 115px solid transparent;
    border-top: 78px solid #cf8f9a;
    transform-origin: top center;
    transition: transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);
    z-index:3;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3));
  }
  .envelope.open .envelope-flap{
    transform: rotateX(180deg);
    z-index:0;
  }
  .envelope:not(.open):hover{ transform: translateY(-3px); }
  .envelope{ transition: transform 0.25s ease; }

  .envelope-hint{
    margin-top:0.9rem;
    font-family:'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size:0.85rem;
    letter-spacing:0.2em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    z-index:1;
  }
  .envelope.open ~ .envelope-hint{ opacity:0; }

  .letter-overlay{
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    background: rgba(20,10,18,0);
    transition: background 0.6s ease;
    z-index:30;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .letter-overlay.active{
    background: rgba(20,10,18,0.78);
    pointer-events:auto;
  }

  .letter-paper{
    position:fixed;
    left:50%; top:58%;
    transform: translate(-50%,-50%) scale(0.25);
    opacity:0;
    width:min(90vw, 480px);
    max-height:75vh;
    background: var(--cream);
    border-radius:12px;
    box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    padding: 2.4rem 2rem;
    overflow-y:auto;
    z-index:31;
    transition: all 0.7s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .letter-paper.active{
    top:50%;
    transform: translate(-50%,-50%) scale(1);
    opacity:1;
    pointer-events:auto;
  }

  #letter-close{
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
    left:100%;
    width:30px;
    height:30px;
    margin-bottom: -30px;
    border:none;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--plum-deep);
    font-family:'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size:1.3rem;
    line-height:1;
    cursor:pointer;
    opacity:0.55;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  #letter-close:hover{
    opacity:1;
    transform: scale(1.1);
  }

  .poem{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-style:italic;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height:1.95;
    color: var(--plum-deep);
    white-space: pre-line;
    text-align:left;
  }

  #close-letter{
    display:block;
    margin: 1.6rem auto 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rose), var(--gold));
    border:none;
    color: var(--plum-deep);
    padding: 0.7rem 1.8rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-family:'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size:0.9rem;
    cursor:pointer;
  }

  /* ---- Interface GOSSIPALMA ---- */
  body.gossip-active .petal,
  body.gossip-active .deco-icon{
    display:none;
  }
  #gossip{
    display:none;
    min-height:100vh;
    width:100%;
    background: var(--gossip-bg);
    color: var(--gossip-ink);
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    opacity:0;
    transition: opacity 0.8s ease;
    z-index:2;
  }
  #gossip.visible{
    display:flex;
    opacity:1;
  }
  .gossip-header{
    width:100%;
    text-align:center;
    padding: 3.4rem 1.5rem 1.6rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gossip-line);
    position:relative;
  }
  .gossip-header .kiss-mark{
    position:absolute;
    font-size:1.8rem;
    opacity:0.75;
  }
  .gossip-header .kiss-mark.h1{ top:18px; left:12%; transform: rotate(-12deg); }
  .gossip-header .kiss-mark.h2{ top:34px; right:14%; transform: rotate(16deg); }
  .gossip-logo{
    font-family:'Give You Glory', cursive;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 10vw, 4.4rem);
    color: var(--gossip-ink);
    line-height:1;
  }
  .gossip-tagline{
    margin-top:0.5rem;
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style:italic;
    font-size:1rem;
    letter-spacing:0.03em;
    color: var(--gossip-caption);
  }
  .gossip-tagline em{ color: var(--gold); font-style:italic; }

  .gossip-feed{
    width:100%;
    max-width: 480px;
    padding: 2.6rem 1.5rem 1rem;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap: 2.8rem;
  }
  .gossip-post{ text-align:center; position:relative; }
  .gossip-photo-wrap{
    position:relative;
  }
  .gossip-photo{
    display:block;
    width:100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    object-fit: cover;
    background: #e9e2d8;
    border-radius:2px;
    border: 10px solid #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(24,20,16,0.18);
  }
  .kiss-mark{
    position:absolute;
    font-size: 2rem;
    opacity:0.85;
    pointer-events:none;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 3px rgba(24,20,16,0.25));
    z-index:2;
  }
  .kiss-mark.tl{ top:-14px; left:-10px; transform: rotate(-18deg); }
  .kiss-mark.br{ bottom:6px; right:-12px; transform: rotate(14deg); }

  .gossip-stats{
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    gap: 1.4rem;
    font-family:'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-weight:500;
    font-size:0.85rem;
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
    color: #ffffff;
    opacity:0.9;
  }
  .gossip-stats span{ display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:0.3rem; }

  .gossip-caption{
    margin-top:0.7rem;
    font-family:'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-weight:400;
    font-style:normal;
    font-size:1.05rem;
    line-height:1.5;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .gossip-cta-label{
    margin-top: 3.6rem;
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-style:italic;
    font-size:1.15rem;
    color: var(--gossip-ink);
    text-align:center;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }
  #gossip-continue{
    margin: 1rem 0 4rem;
    background: var(--gossip-ink);
    color: var(--gossip-bg);
    border:none;
    padding: 1rem 2.6rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-family:'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size:1rem;
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  #gossip-continue:hover{ transform: translateY(-2px); }

  header{
    text-align:center;
    padding: 4.5rem 1.5rem 1.5rem;
    z-index:1;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    font-size:0.72rem;
    letter-spacing:0.35em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom:1rem;
  }
  h1{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-weight:500;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height:1.1;
    color: var(--cream);
  }
  h1 em{
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--rose);
  }
  .sub{
    margin-top:1rem;
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style:italic;
    font-size:1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  main{
    z-index:1;
    width:100%;
    max-width: 560px;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    position:relative;
  }

  .card{
    width:100%;
    min-height: 190px;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(247,237,230,0.06), rgba(247,237,230,0.02));
    border: 1px solid rgba(232,180,188,0.25);
    border-radius: 18px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    padding: 2.2rem 1.8rem;
    position:relative;
    transition: transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1), opacity 0.4s ease;
  }
  .card.flip{ transform: rotateX(90deg); opacity:0; }

  .counter{
    position:absolute;
    top:14px;
    left:20px;
    font-size:0.68rem;
    letter-spacing:0.18em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
  }

  .message{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 3.4vw, 1.6rem);
    text-align:center;
    line-height:1.5;
    color: var(--cream);
  }

  .placeholder{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style:italic;
    font-size:1.3rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  button#reveal{
    margin-top: 2.2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rose), var(--gold));
    color: var(--plum-deep);
    border:none;
    padding: 1rem 2.6rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-family:'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-weight:500;
    font-size:1rem;
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
    cursor:pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(232,180,188,0.25);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    position:relative;
    overflow:visible;
  }
  button#reveal:hover{
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(232,180,188,0.35);
  }
  button#reveal:active{ transform: translateY(0px) scale(0.98); }
  button#reveal:focus-visible{ outline: 2px solid var(--gold); outline-offset:3px; }

  .hint{
    margin-top:0.9rem;
    font-size:0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    opacity:0.9;
  }

  .reasons-view, .finale-view{
    width:100%;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease;
  }
  .reasons-view.fade-out, .finale-view.fade-out{
    opacity:0;
    pointer-events:none;
    position:absolute;
  }
  .finale-view{
    display:none;
    opacity:0;
  }
  .finale-view.visible{
    display:flex;
    opacity:1;
  }

  .progress-dots{
    display:flex;
    gap:0.55rem;
    margin-top:1.4rem;
  }
  .progress-dots .dot{
    width:8px; height:8px;
    border-radius:50%;
    border:1.5px solid rgba(232,180,188,0.5);
    background:transparent;
    transition: background 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
  }
  .progress-dots .dot.filled{
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rose), var(--gold));
    border-color: transparent;
    transform: scale(1.15);
  }

  .finale-flourish{
    font-size:1.6rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    opacity:0.85;
    margin-bottom:0.6rem;
  }
  .finale-label{
    font-family:'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size:0.72rem;
    letter-spacing:0.3em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom:1.6rem;
  }
  .finale-poem{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-style:italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 3.6vw, 1.4rem);
    line-height:2;
    text-align:center;
    color: var(--cream);
    white-space: pre-line;
    max-width:460px;
  }

  /* garden of collected hearts */
  .garden-label{
    margin-top: 3rem;
    font-size:0.7rem;
    letter-spacing:0.25em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    opacity:0.85;
  }
  .garden{
    margin-top:0.9rem;
    width:100%;
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:0.5rem;
    justify-content:center;
    min-height: 2.2rem;
  }
  .garden span{
    font-size:1.15rem;
    animation: pop 0.4s ease;
  }
  @keyframes pop{
    from{ transform: scale(0); }
    to{ transform: scale(1); }
  }

  footer{
    z-index:1;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    text-align:center;
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style:italic;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size:0.95rem;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .petal, .deco-icon{ animation:none; display:none; }
    .card, button#reveal, .envelope-flap, .letter-paper{ transition:none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="music-player" id="music-player">
  <iframe src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/track/2ZWlPOoWh0626oTaHrnl2a?utm_source=generator&theme=0"
    frameborder="0"
    allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture"
    title="Frank Ocean - Ivy"></iframe>
  <a class="music-fallback" href="https://open.spotify.com/track/2ZWlPOoWh0626oTaHrnl2a" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ça ne joue pas ? Ouvrir sur Spotify ↗</a>
</div>
<button class="music-arrow" id="music-hide" aria-label="Masquer le lecteur" title="Masquer le lecteur">›</button>
<button class="music-arrow" id="music-show" aria-label="Afficher le lecteur" title="Afficher le lecteur">‹</button>

<div class="gate" id="gate">
  <p class="music-note">🎵 Alma, clique sur la musique en bas de l'écran. Si elle ne joue pas, cherche-la directement sur Spotify : "Ivy" de Frank Ocean, un de mes sons préférés.</p>
  <p class="gate-question">Coucou Alma, ça va ?</p>
  <p class="gate-answer" id="gate-answer"></p>
  <div class="gate-buttons" id="gate-buttons">
    <button id="yes-btn">Oui</button>
    <button id="no-btn">Non</button>
  </div>
  <button id="continue-btn">Continuer ✦</button>
</div>

<div id="presentation">
  <p class="presentation-title">Une petite surprise pour toi 🤍</p>
  <p class="presentation-sub">Clique sur l'enveloppe pour l'ouvrir</p>

  <div class="envelope" id="envelope">
    <div class="envelope-body"><span class="envelope-icon">💌</span></div>
    <div class="envelope-flap"></div>
  </div>
  <p class="envelope-hint">Ouvrir la lettre</p>
</div>

<div class="letter-overlay" id="letter-overlay"></div>
<div class="letter-paper" id="letter-paper">
  <button id="letter-close" aria-label="Fermer la lettre">✕</button>
  <p class="poem" id="poem-text"></p>
  <button id="close-letter">Continuer ✦</button>
</div>

<div id="gossip">
  <header class="gossip-header">
    <span class="kiss-mark h1">💋</span>
    <p class="gossip-logo">GOSSIPALMA</p>
    <p class="gossip-tagline">On sait que tu m'aimes. <em>xoxo</em></p>
    <span class="kiss-mark h2">💋</span>
  </header>

